  "disabled": false,
  "selftest": false,
  "notes": "harn serve acp resolves its LLM provider via HARN_LLM_PROVIDER; 'local' + LOCAL_LLM_BASE_URL is the documented self-hosted endpoint path — routes model calls to the mock LLM. OPENAI_* covers the openai fallback.",
